  "method": "Sentinel-2 L2A (Earth Search sentinel-2-c1-l2a), B8A/B12 surface reflectance at 20 m (DN*scale+offset from raster:bands). NBR=(B8A-B12)/(B8A+B12); dNBR=NBR_pre-NBR_post, no offset correction. Masked on either date: SCL 0,1,3,6,8,9,10,11, band nodata, reflectance<=0. Classes (Key & Benson 2006 / USGS): unburned<0.10, low 0.10-0.27, moderate-low 0.27-0.44, moderate-high 0.44-0.66, high>=0.66. Computed on the EPSG:32719 20 m grid over the perimeter bbox + 3 km; MGRS tiles mosaicked by deepest-inside tile; areas corrected for UTM scale factor. Perimeter rasterized at pixel centres. PNG resampled by nearest neighbour to a ~20 m Web-Mercator-row grid. Scenes: least SCL-obstructed acquisition in each period."
